@startuml sequence_http_query
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title HTTP Query -> HTTP Response

actor User
participant "Angular SPA" as SPA
participant "BFF HTTP\n/api/queries" as HTTP
participant "MessageBusBridge" as Br
participant "IMessageBus" as Bus
database "Redis" as Redis
participant "Building Service" as Building

User -> SPA: open dashboard
SPA -> HTTP: POST /api/queries\n{ type: "Contracts.Queries.ListRooms", payload: {} }
HTTP -> Br: SendAsync(name, payload)
Br -> Br: resolve CLR type via\nMessageTypeRegistry
Br -> Bus: SendAsync<ListRoomsResult>(typed query)
Bus -> Redis: PUBLISH qry.Contracts.ListRooms
Redis -> Building: deliver
Building -> Redis: PUBLISH rep.bff.{instance}\n{ correlationId, payload = result }
Redis -> Bus: deliver reply
Bus --> Br: ListRoomsResult
Br --> HTTP: object
HTTP --> SPA: 200 OK\n{ rooms: [...] }
SPA --> User: render table

@enduml
